Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 02:03:00 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1131/1179] The Engine's LoRAs in two groups; the About card's
 credits on a line of their own (1166, part eleven)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 04.10.2026: «В Engine раздели блок LoRA на два: ЛОКАЛЬНЫЕ оттрененные где `нет ссылки на
источник`, и второй — те чужие адаптеры из HF»; «После лого новая строка».

- The LoRA card: "Trained here" (the files with no web link to a source in loras/sources.json:
  the duduk, shofar, Fosforida and GTSinger runs) and "From Hugging Face" (the others, with the
  add-on badge, which leaves the card's title: ours are no add-on); a group with none hides.
- The About card: About and its credits start under the logo.
- "Trained here", "From Hugging Face" in the six catalogs (2,432 keys each).

Checked headless in Russian: 24 trained here, 5 from Hugging Face; the About line under the logo.
cdp-console 317/0/7 (the LoRA checks read both groups; one more check: the split itself),
check-i18n 14/0, check-player 3/0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
